    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Legend of Sahur</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An epic adventure about love, courage, and hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong>TUNG TUNG TUNG SAHUR</strong>, the brave stickman on a journey to rescue his beloved <strong>Ballerina Cappuccina</strong> from the clutches of the powerful <strong>Deer King, Luguanluguanlulushijiandaole</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you\u2019ll travel through forest towns, scorching deserts, battle cities, misty tree seas, and the eerie Deer Castle. Meet a cast of unforgettable allies\u2014<br>including your long-lost brother <strong>Ta Ta Ta Sahur</strong>, the ocean-powered three-legged shark <strong>Tralalero Tralala</strong>, your lover\u2019s ex-boyfriend <strong>Cappuccino Assassino</strong>, and the ever-energetic orange warrior <strong>U Din Din Din Din Dun Ma Din Din Din Dun</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To save your beloved, you must defeat the guardian who commands the power of time itself\u2014only then can you confront the Deer King and his unstoppable time-freezing magic.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven adventure blending humor and action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A diverse cast of companions and side quests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices that shape the story and determine the ending</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore five unique regions and uncover hidden truths</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to pick up your stick and challenge fate?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Legend of Sahur</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An epic adventure about love, courage, and hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong>TUNG TUNG TUNG SAHUR</strong>, the brave stickman on a journey to rescue his beloved <strong>Ballerina Cappuccina</strong> from the clutches of the powerful <strong>Deer King, Luguanluguanlulushijiandaole</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you\u2019ll travel through forest towns, scorching deserts, battle cities, misty tree seas, and the eerie Deer Castle. Meet a cast of unforgettable allies\u2014<br>including your long-lost brother <strong>Ta Ta Ta Sahur</strong>, the ocean-powered three-legged shark <strong>Tralalero Tralala</strong>, your lover\u2019s ex-boyfriend <strong>Cappuccino Assassino</strong>, and the ever-energetic orange warrior <strong>U Din Din Din Din Dun Ma Din Din Din Dun</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To save your beloved, you must defeat the guardian who commands the power of time itself\u2014only then can you confront the Deer King and his unstoppable time-freezing magic.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven adventure blending humor and action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A diverse cast of companions and side quests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices that shape the story and determine the ending</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore five unique regions and uncover hidden truths</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to pick up your stick and challenge fate?</p>",
